{
  "campaign_id": "the-stripped-town",
  "content": {
    "dialogues": [
      {
        "nodes": [
          {
            "id": "dlg/ansel-hello",
            "options": [
              {
                "forbids_flags": [
                  "flag/asked-for-parcel"
                ],
                "label": "We got your letter.",
                "next": "dlg/ansel-errand"
              },
              {
                "label": "Where is everyone?",
                "next": "dlg/ansel-town"
              },
              {
                "label": "Which house again?",
                "next": "dlg/ansel-which-house",
                "requires_flags": [
                  "flag/asked-for-parcel"
                ]
              }
            ],
            "text": "Carriers, are you? Good. I'd begun to think nobody read letters any more."
          },
          {
            "id": "dlg/ansel-errand",
            "options": [
              {
                "effects": [
                  {
                    "flag": "flag/asked-for-parcel",
                    "type": "set-flag"
                  },
                  {
                    "objective": "obj/meet-ansel",
                    "type": "complete-objective"
                  }
                ],
                "happening": {
                  "subject": "npc/ansel",
                  "text": "Ansel asks the carriers to fetch Marra's parcel.",
                  "verb": "learns"
                },
                "label": "We'll fetch it."
              },
              {
                "label": "Which house?",
                "next": "dlg/ansel-which-house"
              }
            ],
            "text": "Then here's the job. My sister Marra went inland with the rest. She left one parcel for me, in the chest at the foot of her bed, and I can't leave the boat on this tide. Fetch it, and I'll take you across."
          },
          {
            "id": "dlg/ansel-which-house",
            "options": [
              {
                "label": "Back.",
                "next": "dlg/ansel-hello"
              }
            ],
            "text": "Turn round and walk up the street. First door on your right. The chest at the foot of her bed. Everything else in that street went in the carts."
          },
          {
            "id": "dlg/ansel-town",
            "options": [
              {
                "label": "Back.",
                "next": "dlg/ansel-hello"
              }
            ],
            "text": "Inland. The herring moved off two winters back and didn't come again. In the autumn they loaded every cart in Saltlow and went. I don't like walking that street now. I grew up in half those houses."
          },
          {
            "id": "dlg/ansel-return",
            "options": [
              {
                "effects": [
                  {
                    "objective": "obj/hand-it-over",
                    "type": "complete-objective"
                  }
                ],
                "label": "Here's the parcel.",
                "next": "dlg/ansel-thanks"
              }
            ],
            "text": "Is that it? Let me see."
          },
          {
            "id": "dlg/ansel-thanks",
            "options": [
              {
                "label": "Let's go."
              }
            ],
            "text": "That's it. That's her knot on it. Right. Get in, and mind the gunwale. The tide won't wait for anyone, and there's nobody left to wait for."
          }
        ],
        "npc": "npc/ansel",
        "root": "dlg/ansel-hello"
      }
    ]
  },
  "dsl_version": "0.43.0",
  "stage": "dialogue"
}
